<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Proofs</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Proofs of Preliminary Lemma</h3>

<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.1</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Theorem 1 in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hagedorn (2022)</a></cite>; specialized version of Theorem 2.2.9 (ii) in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">Kollo and Von Rosen (2005)</a></cite>)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}\sim\mathcal{W}({\mathbf{\Sigma}},n)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}\sim\mathcal{W}({\mathbf{\Sigma}},n)</annotation></semantics></math> be a <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\times d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\times d</annotation></semantics></math> random matrix following the Wishart distribution, where <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{\Sigma}}\in\mathbb{S}_{++}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi>𝕊</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mo lspace="0em">⁣</mo><mo>+</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{\Sigma}}\in\mathbb{S}_{++}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> is positive definite and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n\in{\mathbb{N}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n\in{\mathbb{N}}</annotation></semantics></math>. Consider a symmetric matrix <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{A}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{A}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d}</annotation></semantics></math>, then</span></p>
<table id="A1.E38" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]=n\cdot\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+n(n+1){\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐐𝐀𝐐</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]=n\cdot\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+n(n+1){\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(38)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.2</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Theorem 4.2 in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib11" title="" class="ltx_ref">Magnus and Neudecker (1979)</a></cite>; see also <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">Tracy and Sultan (1993)</a></cite>)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}\sim\mathcal{N}({\mathbf{0}}_{d},{\mathbf{\Sigma}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mn>𝟎</mn><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}\sim\mathcal{N}({\mathbf{0}}_{d},{\mathbf{\Sigma}})</annotation></semantics></math> be a <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>-dimensional random vector following the multivariate normal distribution, where <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{\Sigma}}\in\mathbb{S}_{++}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi>𝕊</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mo lspace="0em">⁣</mo><mo>+</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{\Sigma}}\in\mathbb{S}_{++}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> is positive definite. Consider symmetric matrices <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{A}},{\mathbf{B}},{\mathbf{C}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐁</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>𝐂</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{A}},{\mathbf{B}},{\mathbf{C}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d}</annotation></semantics></math>, then</span></p>
<ol id="A1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(i)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{x}}]=\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})+2\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐀𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐁𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{x}}]=\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})+2\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}).</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(ii)</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{x}}]=\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})+2\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐀𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐁𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐂𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐂</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐂</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{x}}]=\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})+2\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\quad+2\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})+2\tr({\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})+8\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐂</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐂</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐂</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\quad+2\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})+2\tr({\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})+8\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{C}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.i2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.3</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{0}_{d},{\mathbf{\Sigma}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mn>𝟎</mn><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{0}_{d},{\mathbf{\Sigma}})</annotation></semantics></math> be a <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>-dimensional random vector where
<math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{\Sigma}}\in\mathbb{S}_{++}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi>𝕊</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mo lspace="0em">⁣</mo><mo>+</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{\Sigma}}\in\mathbb{S}_{++}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> is positive definite. Consider matrices <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{A}},{\mathbf{B}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{d\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐁</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{A}},{\mathbf{B}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{d\times d}</annotation></semantics></math>, then</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx18" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E39"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐀𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐁𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E39.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{B}}^{\top}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{B}}+{\mathbf{B}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐁</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>𝐁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{B}}^{\top}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{B}}+{\mathbf{B}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(39)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E40.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}+{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{B}}+{\mathbf{B}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}+{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{B}}+{\mathbf{B}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>tr</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐁</mi><mi>𝚺</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐁</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>𝐁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐁</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>𝐁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\tr({\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}+{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{B}}+{\mathbf{B}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}+{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{B}}+{\mathbf{B}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(40)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">If <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{A}}={\mathbf{B}}^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>𝐁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{A}}={\mathbf{B}}^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math>, it reduces to</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E41"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐀𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐁𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E41.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})^{2}\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝚺</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})^{2}\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}+\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(41)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E42"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E42.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+2\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}+2{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>tr</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mi>𝚺</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>𝚺</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>𝚺</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+2\tr({\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{\Sigma}})\cdot{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}+2{\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}({\mathbf{A}}+{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}){\mathbf{\Sigma}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(42)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Denote <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{i}:=[{\mathbf{x}}]_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{i}:=[{\mathbf{x}}]_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{i,j}:=[{\mathbf{\Sigma}}]_{i,j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>:=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝚺</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{i,j}:=[{\mathbf{\Sigma}}]_{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i,j}:=[{\mathbf{A}}]_{i,j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>:=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i,j}:=[{\mathbf{A}}]_{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{i,j}:=[{\mathbf{B}}]_{i,j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>:=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐁</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{i,j}:=[{\mathbf{B}}]_{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math>. Then</span></p>
<table id="A1.E43" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E43.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}]_{ij}=\sum_{k\in[d]}\sum_{l\in[d]}\sum_{m\in[d]}\sum_{n\in[d]}a_{kl}b_{mn}\cdot x_{i}x_{k}x_{l}x_{m}x_{n}x_{j}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐀𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐁𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{B}}{\mathbf{x}}{\mathbf{x}}^{\top}]_{ij}=\sum_{k\in[d]}\sum_{l\in[d]}\sum_{m\in[d]}\sum_{n\in[d]}a_{kl}b_{mn}\cdot x_{i}x_{k}x_{l}x_{m}x_{n}x_{j}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(43)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">By <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib12" title="" class="ltx_ref">Isserlis (1918)</a></cite> theorem, for <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i,j,k,l,m\in[d]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i,j,k,l,m\in[d]</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E44"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E44.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[x_{i}x_{j}x_{k}x_{l}x_{m}x_{n}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[x_{i}x_{j}x_{k}x_{l}x_{m}x_{n}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E44.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma_{ij}\sigma_{kl}\sigma_{mn}+\sigma_{ij}\sigma_{km}\sigma_{nl}+\sigma_{ij}\sigma_{kn}\sigma_{ml}+\sigma_{ik}\sigma_{lj}\sigma_{mn}+\sigma_{ik}\sigma_{lm}\sigma_{nj}+\sigma_{ik}\sigma_{ln}\sigma_{mj}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma_{ij}\sigma_{kl}\sigma_{mn}+\sigma_{ij}\sigma_{km}\sigma_{nl}+\sigma_{ij}\sigma_{kn}\sigma_{ml}+\sigma_{ik}\sigma_{lj}\sigma_{mn}+\sigma_{ik}\sigma_{lm}\sigma_{nj}+\sigma_{ik}\sigma_{ln}\sigma_{mj}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(44)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E45"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E45.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sigma_{il}\sigma_{kj}\sigma_{mn}+\sigma_{il}\sigma_{km}\sigma_{nj}+\sigma_{il}\sigma_{kn}\sigma_{mj}+\sigma_{im}\sigma_{nj}\sigma_{kl}+\sigma_{im}\sigma_{nk}\sigma_{lj}+\sigma_{im}\sigma_{nl}\sigma_{kj}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sigma_{il}\sigma_{kj}\sigma_{mn}+\sigma_{il}\sigma_{km}\sigma_{nj}+\sigma_{il}\sigma_{kn}\sigma_{mj}+\sigma_{im}\sigma_{nj}\sigma_{kl}+\sigma_{im}\sigma_{nk}\sigma_{lj}+\sigma_{im}\sigma_{nl}\sigma_{kj}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(45)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E46"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E46.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sigma_{in}\sigma_{mj}\sigma_{kl}+\sigma_{in}\sigma_{mk}\sigma_{lj}+\sigma_{in}\sigma_{ml}\sigma_{kj}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sigma_{in}\sigma_{mj}\sigma_{kl}+\sigma_{in}\sigma_{mk}\sigma_{lj}+\sigma_{in}\sigma_{ml}\sigma_{kj}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(46)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">We further denote <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a^{\top}_{i,j}:=[{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}]_{i,j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo>:=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a^{\top}_{i,j}:=[{\mathbf{A}}^{\top}]_{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b^{\top}_{i,j}:=[{\mathbf{B}}^{\top}]_{i,j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo>:=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi>𝐁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b^{\top}_{i,j}:=[{\mathbf{B}}^{\top}]_{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math>, which implies <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i,j}=a^{\top}_{j,i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i,j}=a^{\top}_{j,i}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{i,j}=b^{\top}_{j,i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{i,j}=b^{\top}_{j,i}</annotation></semantics></math>, then</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E47"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle a_{kl}b_{mn}\cdot\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[x_{i}x_{j}x_{k}x_{l}x_{m}x_{n}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle a_{kl}b_{mn}\cdot\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[x_{i}x_{j}x_{k}x_{l}x_{m}x_{n}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E47.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma_{ij}\cdot\sigma_{kl}a^{\top}_{lk}\cdot\sigma_{mn}b^{\top}_{nm}+\sigma_{ij}\left(\sigma_{km}b_{mn}\sigma_{nl}a^{\top}_{lk}+\sigma_{kn}b^{\top}_{nm}\sigma_{ml}a^{\top}_{lk}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma_{ij}\cdot\sigma_{kl}a^{\top}_{lk}\cdot\sigma_{mn}b^{\top}_{nm}+\sigma_{ij}\left(\sigma_{km}b_{mn}\sigma_{nl}a^{\top}_{lk}+\sigma_{kn}b^{\top}_{nm}\sigma_{ml}a^{\top}_{lk}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(47)</span></td></tr></tbody>
