</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">By using Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem3" title="Lemma A.3. ‣ A.1 Proofs of Preliminary Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs ‣ Fine-Tuning Without Forgetting In-Context Learning:A Theoretical Analysis of Linear Attention Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>,</span></p>
