<p id="A1.SS2.p7.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p7.2.1" class="ltx_text">and by using Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2 (Theorem 4.2 in ( ) ; see also ( ) ). ‣ A.1 Proofs of Preliminary Lemma ‣ Appendix A Proofs ‣ Fine-Tuning Without Forgetting In-Context Learning:A Theoretical Analysis of Linear Attention Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>,</span></p>
