<p id="A1.SS2.p10.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p10.2.1" class="ltx_text">which implies that the expressions in (<a href="#A1.E140" title="Equation 140 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.2 Proofs of Statistical Properties of Model Outputs ‣ Appendix A Proofs ‣ Fine-Tuning Without Forgetting In-Context Learning:A Theoretical Analysis of Linear Attention Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">140</span></a>) and (<a href="#A1.E154" title="Equation 154 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.2 Proofs of Statistical Properties of Model Outputs ‣ Appendix A Proofs ‣ Fine-Tuning Without Forgetting In-Context Learning:A Theoretical Analysis of Linear Attention Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">154</span></a>) simplify to</span></p>
