{Z}}_{[n]},{\mathbf{x}};{\mathbf{V}},{\mathbf{Q}})-y\right)\left(\hat{y}_{\mathrm{ZS}}({\mathbf{x}};{\mathbf{V}},{\mathbf{Q}})-y\right)\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
